###

# Revoke Non-existent Token (should fail)
POST {{API_URL}}/auth.v1.AuthService/RevokeHubToken HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token_id": "99999"
}

